  = note: could not prove `for<'a> &&'a () well-formed`
```

This compiles:
```rust
fn wut()
where
    for<'a> &'static &'a (): Send,
{
}

fn main() {
    wut();
}
```

Here's another variant.

This errors:
```rust
fn wut<'a>()
where
    for<'b> (&'static &'a (), &'b ()):,
{
}

fn main() {
    wut();
}
```
